Awarded: $47,600, being fees and expenses attributable to the two claims th=
e Division withdrew in December, with the hourly rate adjusted down to the =
statutory cap plus a cost-of-living adjustment. The adjudicator declined to=
 find special factors justifying the higher rate.<br />
<br />
Denied: the balance. The decision holds the Division's position on the thre=
e tried claims substantially justified and expressly says that a party that=
 loses on the merits is not thereby entitled to fees.<br />
<br />
The sentence worth internalizing is on page 14, that the Division's justifi=
cation for a claim is assessed as of the time the claim was asserted and is=
 not cured by the later decision to withdraw it.<br />
